# The .html files here are generated, self-contained comparison reports (make_report.py),
# with images base64-embedded -- ~700 KB each. Left unmarked they dwarf the ~130 KB of
# Python and GitHub reports the repo as "mostly HTML". Mark them generated so Linguist
# excludes them from the language stats and collapses them in diffs.
*.html linguist-generated=true

# Model checkpoints and the frozen canonical assets are binary; be explicit so git never
# tries to diff or line-ending-normalize them.
*.pt  binary
*.npz binary
*.png binary
